  "name": "MathlibAnnex.Analysis.CStarAlgebra.exists_character_annihilating_closedIdeal_of_not_mem",
  "natural_language_statement": "Let D be a commutative unital complex C*-algebra, J an ideal whose carrier is norm-closed, and d∈D with d∉J. There is a character χ of D that vanishes on every x∈J while χ(d)≠0. Properness follows from d∉J and is not separately assumed.",
  "one_sentence_role": "Separates an element from a closed ideal of a commutative C*-algebra by a character vanishing on the ideal.",
